{
	//Name
	"Name.Faust": "Faust",
	
	
	//Strings
	"FaustRoom.1": "An old sword. It appears to get some use, judging from the lack of dust build-up.",
	"FaustRoom.2": "These flowers are long dead. Beneath the vase is an envelope that just has 'From Mom' scrawled on it.",
	"FaustRoom.3": "'To Kill a Mocking Bird', by Harper Lee.",
	"FaustRoom.4": "'The Tragedy of Macbeth', by William Shakespeare.",
	"FaustRoom.5": "'The Sorrows of Young Werther', by Johann Wolfgang.",
	"FaustRoom.6": "Recently purchased cans of beer.",
	"FaustRoom.7": "A collection of poems. Some of the covers are wearing from age.",
	"FaustRoom.8": "It's left open on 'The Haunted Palace', by Edgar Allan Poe.",
	
	"FaustRoom.2.MomLetter": "There's an open letter beside the vase.#'To my dearest Faust,'#'If you've found this, then that means I'm probably dead. Or maybe I'm not home! But it's probably the latter.'#'I'm so, so sorry you had to watch us fight that day, and I'm even more sorry that I couldn't be there with you and your father.'#'I have a duty to the Guild and to the Valley. I couldn't forsake it just because your father wanted me to. I hope you can understand that.'#'I've been waiting for you and your father to come back home, but it's been a year now, so I doubt your father has forgiven me. Now I just hope that the two of you are safe.'#'Faust, please know that I still think of you even as I wield my blade in combat. I've never forgotten you, and I never will.'",
	
	"FaustSpouseRoom.1": "Faust's collection of poetry. Most of them are old books of old poems.",
	"FaustSpouseRoom.2": "All of Faust's books that he's accumulated over the years. You recognize many of the titles along the spines.",
	"FaustSpouseRoom.3": "Faust's sword. He cleans it regularly.",
	
	"MomsGrave.1": "\"LIBITINA GRIMM\"^^\"FOUGHT TO PROTECT ALL SHE HELD DEAR UNTIL HER DYING BREATH.\"^^^It's very well maintained, with no signs of damage or overgrowth.",
	"MomsGrave.2": "\"LIBITINA GRIMM\"^^\"FOUGHT TO PROTECT ALL SHE HELD DEAR UNTIL HER DYING BREATH.\"^^^You offer a quick prayer to Faust's departed mother. Perhaps it will lift her spirits.",
	
	
	//Schedule Strings
	"Sun.000": "..Do you need something? This is no place for idle chatter.$3",
	"nap.000": "Mmhh... Just five more minutes... I'm not ready... *snore*$9",
	"nap.001": "..Hnng..?$9#$b#..Don't mind me... Just taking a quick snooze...$9",
	"yard.000": "Be respectful while you're here.#$b#..You wouldn't want to anger any ghosts, would you?$6",
	"yard.000.married": "Did you come here to visit me? How sweet.$6",
	"mom.000": "..Do NOT bother me right now.$3#$b#..I'm brooding.$2",
	"mom.000.alt": "Can't you see I'm visiting my mom right now? Please leave me be.$2",
	"mom.001": "%Faust refuses to acknowledge you. He looks like he's holding back tears...",
	"married.000": "Don't worry, I'll be back home.. maybe some time before midnight.",
	"married.001": "Do you think you need to babysit me just because we're married? Ha.$6#$b#I promise I'll be fine on my own.$1",
	"married.002": "I figured you'd swing by here at some point.$1#$b#If you want, you can sit with me. I'll even buy you a drink.$1",
	
	//Letters
	"Letter.Faust.TalkInvite": "I want to talk. Please come to Shearwater Bridge some time after dusk. (If it's any earlier, I might fall asleep. I don't wanna fall alseep. This is important.)^^Faust[#]Odd Request from Faust",
	"Letter.Faust.TalkInvite.NoSVE": "I want to talk. Please come to the lake in Cindersap Forest some time after dusk. (If it's any earlier, I might fall asleep. I don't wanna fall alseep. This is important.)^^Faust[#]Odd Request from Faust",
	
	
	//Festival Dialogue
	"Festivals.Faust.Egg.Y1": "Why do some people associate Egg Day with rabbits..? That makes no sense at all.#$e#..I meant the Egg Festival. Same thing.$9",
	"Festivals.Faust.Egg.Y2": "Who decided to make this festival so colorful, anyway..?$9",
	"Festivals.Faust.Egg.Y1.Married": "The others don't stand a chance against you, @. I'm sure you'll get the most eggs.$1",
	
	"Festivals.Faust.Flower.Y1": "All these flowers are attracting bees... I hate bees...$9",
	"Festivals.Faust.Flower.Y2": "Do we have anything good to drink here? This festival makes me depressed.$3",
	"Festivals.Faust.Flower.Y2.Married": "This festival used to make me so miserable... It'd always remind me of how unbearably lonely I was, but I'd just keep putting up with it.$2#$e#Now that I have you, it's not so bad anymore.$1",
	
	"Festivals.Faust.Luau.Y1": "Dear Yoba, it's so hot out...$9",
	"Festivals.Faust.Luau.Y2": "Guess what I put in the soup?$6#$b#Yep, a spice berry that I picked up on the way here.#$e#Obviously I wiped the dirt off it.#$e#..Why are you looking at me like that? Did you think I was gonna say something weird?$9",
	"Festivals.Faust.Luau.Y1.Married": "We could dance together if you'd like. I'm getting pretty bored anyway.",
	"Festivals.Faust.Luau.Y2.Married": "Make sure you put something good in the soup, darling. I don't want to get food poisoning.$1",
	
	"Festivals.Faust.Jellies.Y1": "Some people say that when we die, we become stars.#$b#If that really was the case, I'd rather come back as a Moonlight Jelly. That'd be more interesting than being a star.",
	"Festivals.Faust.Jellies.Y2": "The life of a jellyfish must be so dreadfully aimless... Much like our own.$3",
	"Festivals.Faust.Jellies.Y1.Married": "I'd like to hold your hand as we watch the jellies tonight.$4#$e#No, nothing's wrong. I just want to be close to you.#$b#..Okay, *maybe* I planned on taking a nap on your shoulder. I'm tired.$9",
	"Festivals.Faust.Jellies.Y2.Married": "There you are, darling... I was wondering when you'd get here.$6",
	
	"Festivals.Faust.Fair.Y1": "Sir Clint makes very good quality weapons.$1#$b#I'd love to purchase a blade from him, but the one I have at home holds sentimental value.",
	"Festivals.Faust.Fair.Y2": "I can't believe Sir Lewis would let this happen! They've swallowed up three of the graves! Such disrespect!$5",
	"Festivals.Faust.Fair.Y1.Married": "Would you like me to buy you a new blade, @?$1#$e#I'm sure whatever weapon you have is better than anything I could get you, but I just thought I'd offer.$1",
	
	"Festivals.Faust.Spirits.Y1": "Oh, you found me.#$e#I was trying to convince the Pumpkin King to move off of the headstone, but instead it has taken me as it's servant.$7#$b#I am now the Hand of the Pump-king.$6",
	"Festivals.Faust.Spirits.Y1.NoSVE": "I wonder where they got all these bones from...$7",
	"Festivals.Faust.Spirits.Y2": "I've only ever killed a handful of monsters.#$b#..It was quite fun though, I must admit.$1#$e#Of course, I had to bury everything I killed, lest their spirits came back to haunt me. That was a pain.$9",
	"Festivals.Faust.Spirits.Y2.Married": "I'm certain that you've killed at least a hundred of these, huh, @?$1",
	
	"Festivals.Faust.Ice.Y1": "Don't mind me. I'm just going to bury this deceased animal.#$e#..Why are you looking at me like that? I can't just leave the poor thing's remains here in the snow!$3",
	"Festivals.Faust.Ice.Y1.NoSVE": "..I don't want to go anywhere near the lake...$2#$e#%He refuses to say anything else.",
	"Festivals.Faust.Ice.Y2": "The worst thing about winter is that there are no wild berries growing anymore.$9#$b#Crystal fruits are pretty.. meh. They're nothing compared to blackberries.",
	"Festivals.Faust.Ice.Y1.Married": "Ah, perfect timing. Darling, help me bury these bones.#$b#..Please?$1",
	"Festivals.Faust.Ice.Y1.Married.NoSVE": "There you are, darling. Having you here makes being in this part of town much less.. dreary.#$b#..Don't worry, I don't plan on going near the lake.$1",
	"Festivals.Faust.Ice.Y2.Married": "Ugh... I'm so sleepy...$9#$e#..? Oh, greetings, my darling. Good luck in the fishing contest.$1",
	
	"Festivals.Faust.Feast.Y1": "I haven't had anyone to enjoy the Feast with for years...$3#$b#It's better if I just stay over here. Someone needs to keep these poor souls company, after all.$3",
	"Festivals.Faust.Feast.Y1.NoSVE": "I haven't had anyone to enjoy the Feast with for years...$3#$b#It's better if I just stay over here. I wouldn't want to bother anyone.$3",
	"Festivals.Faust.Feast.Y2": "May Yoba bless the year ahead of you, @.",
	"Festivals.Faust.Feast.Y1.Married": "I'm glad I have you, @. I hope our relationship prospers for years to come.$4",
	"Festivals.Faust.Feast.Y2.Married": "We're going to be entering yet another year... But we have each other.$1",
	
	
	//Event Dialogue
	"Events.Grave.1": "..Salutations.#$b#..Your name is.. @, right?#$b#Have you come here to pay your respects to the departed?",
	"Events.Grave.2": "I'm not just standing here in the dark. I have a lantern, see?$6#$b#..I'm keeping watch over the graveyard, obviously. As it's caretaker, it is my duty to make sure that everything is as it should be.",
	"Events.Grave.3": "#But there's nobody here. Surely you don't need to stand out here all night.#What about the cemetery in town?",
	"Events.Grave.3.NoSVE": "#But there's nobody here. Surely you don't need to stand out here all night.#Seems like a hastle to come all the way down here just to do nothing.",
	"Events.Grave.4.1": "Just because nobody comes here doesn't mean I can leave, you fool.$5#$b#At the very least, I am giving company to the last remaining souls that linger here.#$b#Most of the adventurers here died young, leaving them with unfinished business in this world and binding them to their graves.",
	"Events.Grave.4.2": "I live up here by the railroad. Walking all the way down to the other cemetery is a hastle, so I put most of my focus on the one up here.$3#$b#I do go down and check on it frequently, though. All of the deceased in Pelican Town are under my watch, so behave yourself around them.$3",
	"Events.Grave.4.2.NoSVE": "I am keeping watch over the dead. I consider that something, but you clearly fail to understand.$5#$b#I come down here to check on them frequently, regardless of time. The deceased of Pelican Town are under my watch, so behave yourself around them.$3",
	"Events.Grave.5": "..If you were to disturb any of them, you just might find yourself being haunted, so I would recommend behaving yourself in their resting places.$6",
	"Events.Grave.6": "..Why are you here, anyway..? Especially this late... Considering you're the newest person here, I doubt there is anyone here you'd need to pay respects to...",
	"Events.Grave.7": "#I'm taking a walk before bed.#I'm just foraging.#I wanted to talk to you.",
	"Events.Grave.8.1": "Oh, alright. That makes sense, I suppose.#$b#I wouldn't recommend this place for your walk, though. There's not much to see here aside from the tracks and the graveyard.$9",
	"Events.Grave.8.1.NoSVE": "Oh, alright. That makes sense, I suppose.#$b#I don't see the appeal, but you are free to do as you wish.$9",
	"Events.Grave.8.2": "..You're foraging? Huh. ..Neat.$7#$b#I wouldn't recommend this place for your foraging, though. Not much grows up here. I check for stuff every day, so I would know.$9",
	"Events.Grave.8.2.NoSVE": "..You're foraging? Huh. ..Neat.$7#$b#I wouldn't recommend the middle of town for your foraging, though. Try the forest next time.$9",
	"Events.Grave.8.3": "..Huh????$7#$b#You.. came all the way out here to talk to me? ME?? That's.. weird.$2#$b#..But.. thanks, I guess?",
	"Events.Grave.8.3.NoSVE": "..Huh????$7#$b#You.. came over here to talk to me? ME?? That's.. weird.$2#$b#..But.. thanks, I guess?",
	"Events.Grave.9": "..Hey, sorry if I've been.. kind of awkward, by the way.$3#$b#I don't approach others, and likewise they don't approach me. You're really the only person I've had frequent interactions with, aside from Sir Gus, Sir Marlon, and Lady Susan- and that's just because she's my neighbor.$2#$b#I don't have much.. social experience, so I'm not good with holding conversations.$2",
	"Events.Grave.9.NoSVE": "..Hey, sorry if I've been.. kind of awkward, by the way.$3#$b#I don't approach others, and likewise they don't approach me. You're really the only person I've had frequent interactions with, aside from Sir Gus and Sir Marlon#$b#I don't have much.. social experience, so I'm not good with holding conversations.$2",
	"Events.Grave.10": "Okay, that's enough of that. I don't feel like pitying myself right now.$3#$b#..Well, don't linger here all night. You need sleep more than I do.$3",
	
	"Events.Insomnia.1": "@! I didn't hear you come in..!$7#$b#Maybe you should knock when you enter someone's house... Just a thought.$3",
	"Events.Insomnia.2": "No, I'm fine. I just dozed off- as usual...$2#$b#I don't really do much, thus it doesn't really impede my schedule, so I just kind of let it happen when it does...$2#$b#Luckily, I never actually fall *asleep*, so I don't end up collapsing. It could be pretty bad for me if I did...$1",
	"Events.Insomnia.3": "I was actually going to read one of my books, but now I can't remember which one I wanted to read... Oh well. I think I'll just brew another pot of coffee. I clearly need it today.#$b#This is what I get for staying up two nights in a row again...$9",
	"Events.Insomnia.4": "#Why do you always stay up so late if you're so tired?#Sleeping would probably help. You should take a nap.",
	"Events.Insomnia.5": "Don't try to give me advice. You don't know what's going on with me.$3",
	"Events.Insomnia.6": "*Sigh*... Sorry.",
	"Events.Insomnia.7": "I can't fall asleep, and I can't stay asleep. That's the whole problem.$2#$b#When I do manage to sleep, it's only for a few hours at most. I gave up on trying to have a regular sleep schedule a long time ago because there really was no point in maintaining something that wasn't working at all.$2#$b#I'm not sure what's wrong with me... I'm probably an insomniac, but I'm not one-hundred percent sure... Maybe I just wasn't trying hard enough..?$2#$b#..I'm no doctor though, so I'll never know. I've gotten used to it anyway, so it doesn't matter to me whether I sleep or not.$3",
	"Events.Insomnia.8": "I'm definitely just making it worse, and I'm past the point of getting better. It's been like this for years now. But honestly, I couldn't care less anymore.$3#$b#..Come to think of it, it's probably HIS fault... I wouldn't be surprised if it somehow ties back to how he treated me after he took me from mom...$5",
	"Events.Insomnia.9": "..Ignore me. I'm thinking aloud.$9",
	"Events.Insomnia.10": "#You should go to the clinic.#You need to take better care of yourself.",
	"Events.Insomnia.11.1": "I know, I know...$9#$b#I just don't want to. I... I can't. It's such a small issue. I don't want to bother Sir Harvey with my issues just for him to tell me something I already know.$2#$b#..Plus, I got more important things to spend my money on. Like beer.$6",
	"Events.Insomnia.11.2": "Gee, I never would've thought. Thank you for blessing me with your sagely wisdom.$3#$b#There really isn't a point. I just linger in graveyards most of the day. I don't have a life outside of that. Why bother?$3",
	"Events.Insomnia.12": "..The point is, I don't need help, nor do I want it. Just.. don't worry about me. I'm not worth your concern.$2",
	"Events.Insomnia.13": "..Want some coffee? I can share some with you. You'll just have to wait for it to be done.",
	
	"Events.Mom.1": "Are you heading into the mines? Sorry, I must be in your way...",
	"Events.Mom.2": "What? I'm not doing anything wrong.#$b#It's been a while since I've swung at anything aside from a tree, so I was considering going down there and brushing off my rust a bit.$7#$b#But.. I can't do it... I can't risk my life- not here... Her grave is right up the mountain... If I died so close to her, then surely that would bring her soul nothing but despair...$2",
	"Events.Mom.2.NoSVE": "What? I'm not doing anything wrong.#$b#It's been a while since I've swung at anything aside from a tree, so I was considering going down there and brushing off my rust a bit.$7#$b#But.. I can't do it... I can't risk my life- not here... If I died in our hometown, then surely that would bring her soul nothing but despair...$2",
	"Events.Mom.3": "It's not- ..Oh who am I kidding? I'm the one who brought her up.$3",
	"Events.Mom.4": "..Hey, come with me for a minute. I.. wanna show you something in the graveyard. It'll be quick, I promise.",
	"Events.Mom.5": "..So.. uh... This is where my mom is buried.$2#$b#That's what Sir Marlon said, at least. Who knows how much of her is beneath the soil- if any of her at all.$2#$b#My mom was an adventurer before she settled down in Pelican Town with my father. She served the Guild and protected the town from monsters.$3#$b#I was 6 when my parents had their first and only fight. My father had expressed his worries for mom's safety that night. He wanted her to lay down her blade and leave the Guild, because he was terrified of anything happening to her.$2#$b#..But she refused. She wanted to protect people- including us.$3#$b#But her reasoning didn't matter to him. Their argument lasted all night, and I had to watch the entire time...$5",
	"Events.Mom.6": "When the sun rose, father took me to the bus stop and we left town. He told my mom that until she came to her senses, he'd be waiting for her in Zuzu City. He was confident that she would come crawling back to him in a week or two.$2#$b#He waited, and waited, and waited... But mom never came.$3#$b#Rather than go back to check on her or just move on, he became enraged, and took everything out on me. He-$5#$b#..Sorry, I got carried away. This isn't about him.$3",
	"Events.Mom.7": "I returned to Pelican Town four years before you moved in. I was hoping to see her again.. but our old house was full of dust and cobwebs. Nobody had been in it for years.$2#$b#Sir Marlon told me that she had been killed in combat years ago, and she was buried in the Adventurer's Cemetery. 'She died a valiant death,' he said.$2#$b#I didn't know what to do... I couldn't go back to HIM, so I decided to just.. stay here, in my old home.$3",
	"Events.Mom.7.NoSVE": "I returned to Pelican Town four years before you moved in. I was hoping to see her again.. but our old house was full of dust and cobwebs. Nobody had been in it for years.$2#$b#Sir Marlon told me that she had been killed in combat years ago, and she was buried in the cemetery. 'She died a valiant death,' he said.$2#$b#I didn't know what to do... I couldn't go back to HIM, so I decided to just.. stay here, in my old home.$3",
	"Events.Mom.8": "..Sorry for dumping all of that on you. I've just.. been holding all that in for a few years. Needed to get stuff off my chest.$2#$b#I'll.. escort you back to the mines.",
	
	"Events.Drown.1": "..@. Hey.#$b#If you want a drink, you'll have to wait a minute. Sir Gus is in the back right now. Said he was out of ale.",
	"Events.Drown.2": "#What are you doing here so early?",
	"Events.Drown.3": "Yoba forbid a man needs a drink. I don't see why it matters to you.$3#$b#..Sorry, I'm not in a good mood today. That's why I'm here.$2",
	"Events.Drown.4": "..This morning, I had.. asked Sir Marlon to tell me more about how my mother died. I thought I'd finally be able to handle hearing about it.$2#$b#Alas, I was sorely mistaken. I can't stop thinking about it... About her... Who knew he was such a vivid storyteller...$3#$b#..So now I am here, drowning myself in alcohol- as I always do- to dull the emotions that story stirred. ..Same as HE would...$3",
	"Events.Drown.5": "..I resent myself for being like HIM, but.. it's the easiest way to shut out my thoughts. It's the only way I know how to cope...$2#$b#..Blegh. I'm venting to you again... I'm sorry. I normally don't talk this much...$3",
	"Events.Drown.6": "#It's alright to talk to someone about your feelings and issues.#You should definitely see a therapist. I'm not the right person to talk about this stuff with.",
	"Events.Drown.7.1": "I know, but.. for some reason, I feel like I just can't... Or rather, that I shouldn't.$3#$b#I don't want anyone to worry about me. I don't want to burden anyone with my personal problems. Does that make sense to you..?$2",
	"Events.Drown.7.2": "You think I need a shrink?? Bold of you to assume I could afford a trip to the city, let alone a psychologist!$5",
	"Events.Drown.8.1": "I really can't think of a better way to explain it... You know speaking is not my forte.$2#$b#..I can live just fine without help. I've done it for years, and I can continue doing so until I die. Therapy isn't a necessity...#$b#..But.. I suppose if I do feel the need to talk, I'll.. try seeking someone.$3",
	"Events.Drown.8.2": "*Sigh*... I know I should see someone, but therapy is expensive, and I wouldn't feel comfortable dumping all my problems on someone I don't know.$2#$b#I guess that's why I keep bothering you with them without really thinking about it... Again, I apologize.$3",
	"Events.Drown.9.1": "Not a therapist, though. Those are way too expensive for me. Staring at graves isn't a hard job, so Sir Marlon doesn't pay me much. Pretty sure he's just doing it out of pity, too...$3#$b#..You.. wouldn't mind if I kept telling you about my problems in the future, would you? I wouldn't want to bother Sir Marlon or Sir Gus about this kind of stuff, so you're really my only other option...",
	"Events.Drown.9.2": "Besides, I don't need a therapist when I have the best alternative right here, see? Nothing can mentally support me better than a mug of beer.$6#$b#..Okay, that was just depressing. It was funnier in my head.$3",
	"Events.Drown.10.1": "Thanks... It.. means a lot to me.$1#$b#I really don't understand why you even bother with me in the first place anyway... But I'm glad that you do.$1",
	"Events.Drown.10.2": "*Sigh*... Can we cut this conversation short? I don't feel like talking anymore...$9",
	"Events.Drown.11.1": "..I think I'm gonna head back home. I'm feeling a little better, and I still got things to do today.",
	"Events.Drown.11.2": "I think I just made him more miserable...",
	"Events.Drown.12": "I'll be seeing you around, @.$1",
	
	"Events.Open.1": "Come on, Faust... Pull yourself together! It can't be that bad..!$2",
	"Events.Open.2": "Oh, @..!#$b#..You.. haven't heard the last five minutes of me muttering to myself, have you?$2",
	"Events.Open.3": "*Phew*...",
	"Events.Open.4": "You must be wondering what I'm doing- aimlessly wandering back and forth like this...#$b#Actually, I'm trying to.. motivate myself, in a way.",
	"Events.Open.5": "I... Well...$3#$b#I am.. unbelieveably lonely. You know that. *I* know that. I always tried to tell myself it was no big deal- that I could put up with it, like everything else...$2#$b#But then you started talking to me. I thought that might finally satiate my craving for companionship, and it did for a bit...$3#$b#But now that hunger has only grown. I cannot just continuing relying on you alone for regular human interaction.$2",
	"Events.Open.6": "I.. want to talk to more people.$2#$b#I want to speak with more than just inanimate headstones and crows that arrive on my doorstep in the early hours of the morning.$2#$b#I wish to talk about my interests and hobbies with more people who share them. I wish to have more than just one short conversation a day.$2#$b#But.. I cannot bring myself to go down the mountain... The thought of actively seeking out and talking to people I have never spoken to causes an overwhelming amount of anxiety to swell within my chest..! What if I embarrass myself?$2",
	"Events.Open.7": "Perhaps I'm being too greedy... You talk to me frequently, and I speak with Sir Marlon on a semi-regular basis... That should be more than enough for someone like me.$3",
	"Events.Open.8": "..No, no, I cannot be saying stuff like that right now... I'll just make myself depressed.$3#$b#I need to calm down, suck it up, and get it over with already... If I want to make connections with people, I need to reach out first.$3#$b#I'm not lucky enough for everyone to approach me themselves like you did.$6",
	"Events.Open.9": "#Even if it doesn't work out, it's good that you're trying.#What if I want to be your only friend?",
	"Events.Open.10.1": "...$7#$b#Thank you, @. That means a lot to me...$1",
	"Events.Open.10.2": "...$3#$b#Come on, I'm having a moment. Now's not the time to be making weird jokes. It wasn't even a funny one.$3",
	"Events.Open.11": "..Okay, I'm- ..I'm gonna go down to the library and see if I can find anything interesting to read.$3#$b#And if I see anyone there.. I'll.. talk to them.$3#$b#..Jeez, even just imagining it makes me scared... How sad...$2#$b#But.. I can do it. I'm going to do it. What's the worst that could happen, anyway?$2",
	"Events.Open.12": "If you find me hiding in a corner down there with my face in a book, scold me, okay?$6#$b#Well, I'll be seeing you around, @. Wish me luck.$1",
	"Events.Open.13": "Alright... I'll be fine... It's not a big deal...",
	"Events.Open.14": "..I've read that book before. The writing isn't the best, but it's still entertaining in its own way.",
	"Events.Open.15": "Goodness, you startled me! I hadn't noticed you there.$2#$b#The plot is interesting, but it was executed rather poorly, and there are dozens of loose ends that don't get resolved.$7#$b#If you were to ignore all of it's glaring issues, it is decent, I suppose.#$b#But it's not the kind of material I'm looking for. I'm here returning it.",
	"Events.Open.16": "Faust, right? I don't believe we've ever had the pleasure of speaking, despite how long you've lived here.$1#$b#..But I've also never personally seen you talk to anyone aside from Gus. In fact, I don't see you much at all. You're like a ghost.$7",
	"Events.Open.17": "..I'm.. trying to be more social. Talking to people is hard, so I usually just avoid it.$2",
	"Events.Open.18": "I'll be sure to keep that in mind, then.#$b#I never would have guessed you had an interest in literature, but they do say to never judge a book by it's cover.$1#$b#What's your favorite genre, if I might ask?$1",
	"Events.Open.19": "..I usually prefer things with darker tones, like thrillers and tragedies, but I read other stuff on occasion. It would grow boring if you just stuck to one genre of media.$1",
	"Events.Open.20": "Hmmm... Have you read 'The Sorrows of Young Werther', then? It's really old, but I believe it might be right up your alley.#$b#Personally, I could not bring myself to finish it...$2",
	"Events.Open.21": "Have I? Of course I have! It's one of my favorites.$7#$b#I wish I could recommend something to you, but I fear any book I might suggest may be too.. depressing or macabre for you...",
	"Events.Open.22": "I wouldn't mind. I'd love to hear them. All literature can serve as the fuel to the fires of inspiration.$1",
	"Events.Open.23": "Really? Well, in that case...$1",
	"Events.Open.24": "For whatever reason, you're sure that Faust is doing just fine right now.",
	
	"Events.Bridge.1": "This is stupid... I should leave, before ${he^she}$ gets here...$3",
	"Events.Bridge.2": "Crap... Too late...$9#$b#..Hi, @. You saw my letter, I assume?",
	"Events.Bridge.3": "This bridge... It's a nice place, isn't it?#$b#..I used to come here a lot when I moved back here. After I found out my mother had died...$3#$b#I'd stare down into the water at my reflection and wonder what the point of it all was... I had nothing left. No family, no money...$3#$b#I'd wonder.. 'What if I just disappeared? What if I jumped in and never resurfaced?'$3",
	"Events.Bridge.3.NoSVE": "This lake... It's a nice place, isn't it?#$b#..I used to come here a lot when I moved back here. After I found out my mother had died...$3#$b#I'd stare down into the water at my reflection and wonder what the point of it all was... I had nothing left. No family, no money...$3#$b#I'd wonder.. 'What if I just disappeared? What if I jumped in and never resurfaced?'$3",
	"Events.Bridge.4": "What? No no no! I'm not gonna do that in front of you!$2#$b#I haven't had any thoughts like that in a while, I promise. I haven't even been on this bridge in ages.#$b#Even though everything in this world is for nothing and we serve no greater purpose, I'm trying to find my own meaning to life...",
	"Events.Bridge.4.NoSVE": "What? No no no! I'm not gonna do that in front of you!$2#$b#I haven't had any thoughts like that in a while, I promise. I haven't even been near this lake.#$b#Even though everything in this world is for nothing and we serve no greater purpose, I'm trying to find my own meaning to life...",
	"Events.Bridge.5": "I just.. wanted to warn you. To scare you away.$3#$b#You're the best thing that's happened to me. I don't deserve everything you've done. I'm honored that you have allowed me to be in a relationship with you.$3#$b#..But I'm not worth it... I don't deserve friends or love... I've thought about it a lot, and I can't convince myself otherwise.$2",
	"Events.Bridge.6": "You're wasting your time. None of this.. *thing* you think you're doing through courting me is worth anything.$2#$b#You won't get anything of value from me. Not even my affection is worth anything. You'd be better off with someone else...$2#$b#Someone that isn't a waste of your precious time... Someone better.$3",
	"Events.Bridge.7": "You've already helped me enough... You don't have to keep doing this...$2#$b#You've put all this work into having a relationship with someone who hasn't found their reason to be here. You've put all this work into ME...$2#$b#Though it's unlikely for the time being, what if I give up? What if I really did just vanish? All of this would have been for nothing...$3",
	"Events.Bridge.8": "#Despite everything, I want to be with you.#Faust, you're scaring me.",
	"Events.Bridge.9.1": "But why..? I just can't understand why...$2#$b#Even after I try to make you realize that my number of problems are greater than you imagined, you still insist on wanting to be my partner. I don't get it.$3",
	"Events.Bridge.9.2": "Th-That wasn't my intention... I didn't mean to make you worry about me...$2#$b#Please, just.. forget the whole bit about jumping into the water. I'm just being dramatic.$2",
	"Events.Bridge.10.1": "I thought telling you all that would drive you away... It'd be better if things ended here rather than later down the line in a much worse fashion...$3#$b#It'd be better than you figuring out I'm a bigger mess than you signed up for on your own...$3",
	"Events.Bridge.10.2": "I shouldn't even have brought it up to begin with... I was just.. trying to make you see that there are more problems with me than you'd thought...$3#$b#Clearly that didn't go as intended...$3",
	"Events.Bridge.11": "#What sparked this whole thing..?",
	"Events.Bridge.12": "Just some bad thoughts, that's all... Nothing you should worry about too much...$3",
	"Events.Bridge.13": "..I.. guess it's good that you've stayed with me this long, and that you continue to express worry for me rather than throwing me away.#$b#It means you care... I think, at least. I haven't let anyone close enough to care about me before you...$8#$b#..Saying that out loud sounds so pathetic... Yikes.$9",
	"Events.Bridge.14": "..I know we've already been dating for a bit, but.. I really like you, @. You mean a lot to me.$3#$b#I've never told anyone as much as I've told you. Not ever Sir Marlon.$2#$b#But you... I feel like I can tell you things. All the misfortunes of my past and my darkest thoughts that I've repressed for so, so long... I can tell you those.#$b#..And since meeting you, I haven't felt as scared around people. They still make me anxious, but it's not as severe as it used to be...$1#$b#I attribute that to you. Even if it ends up all being futile, I'm very grateful that you've wasted your time on me.$4",
	"Events.Bridge.15": "..Uhm... I know this request is sudden, and kind of out of place, but...$3#$b#I'm feeling.. emotional- for lack of a better word. We're in a pretty nice spot, and there's just the two of us here...$7#$b#..So, would you mind if I..?$8",
	"Events.Bridge.16": "#Accept#Refuse",
	"Events.Bridge.17.1": "Uhm...$8",
	"Events.Bridge.17.2": "Oh- I-I'm sorry...$2#$b#I didn't consider that everything I said earlier must've made you uncomfortable...$3#$b#Y-You must forgive me... I have no experience with this sort of thing... I-I'd thought...$3",
	"Events.Bridge.18.1": "S-Sorry...$8#$b#This really didn't go the way I was expecting it to... But I guess that's a good thing..?$8#$b#I... I'm gonna go now... Before I embarrass myself any further...$8",
	"Events.Bridge.18.2": "..I-I'll just.. go, then... I think I've done enough here...$2",
	
	"Events.Beach.1": "So, you just.. stand here and pace back and forth for a few hours?",
	"Events.Beach.2": "Indeed I do. I find it relaxing to take my mind off things and look out at the ocean for a while.$1",
	"Events.Beach.3": "But why *here* of all places? The beach is awful... It's too bright, and there's sand everywhere!$3#$b#Surely there is somewhere better than this hellscape you could go to collect your thoughts.$9",
	"Events.Beach.4": "It's really not bad! The breeze is great, there's plenty of sun, and the sound of the waves coming and going is very calming.",
	"Events.Beach.5": "I hate the sun. And sand. It gets in my shoes.$9",
	"Events.Beach.6": "..Well, I suppose it's not everyone's cup of tea.$7#$b#You know, sunscreen would probably help you enjoy it a bit more. I promise it's much nicer when your pasty white skin isn't being burned.$1",
	"Events.Beach.7": "Can't really think of a reason I'd need to come to the beach, but.. maybe. No guarantee, though.$3",
	
	"Events.Disturbance.1": "Still no better than the day before... What am I doing wrong..?$2",
	"Events.Disturbance.2": "So *you* are the one who keeps making that infernal racket in the early hours of the morning.$5",
	"Events.Disturbance.3": "Oh-! I'm terribly sorry, sir... It was not my intention to disturb you...$2",
	"Events.Disturbance.4": "Then play that thing somewhere else! Or at least try to be quieter!$5#$b#Do you have any idea how awful it is to be woken up to the sound of a poorly played instrument? Keep that din confined to the walls of your cabin!$5",
	"Events.Disturbance.5": "I-I'm truly sorry...",
	"Events.Disturbance.6": "*Sigh*",
	"Events.Disturbance.7": "No, no, there's no need to apologize twice...$3#$b#..Forgive me, there was no reason to lash out at you like that. I'm simply irritable and hungover this morning...$9#$b#..I've said my piece. I'll be going back to bed now.$9",
	"Events.Disturbance.8": "..Huh.",
	
	"Events.Anniversary.1": "..What do you want, @..?$2",
	"Events.Anniversary.1.Married": "..Oh, hello, darling. I wasn't expecting to see you here...$2",
	"Events.Anniversary.2": "#I haven't seen you all day...#Are you okay?",
	"Events.Anniversary.2.Married": "#You looked miserable all day...#Why are you over here? This isn't part of your schedule.",
	"Events.Anniversary.3": "..Today is the anniversary of my mother's death.$2#$b#..According to Sir Marlon, at least.$3",
	"Events.Anniversary.4": "Every year, I can barely muster up the will to get out of bed on this day... But I can't just not visit her, so I end up doing so each time.$3#$b#..I miss her, @. I miss her so much...$2#$b#Sometimes, I wonder.. if we had still been around, would she have still lost her life so early..?$2#$b#Is it.. our fault..?$3",
	"Events.Anniversary.5": "#There is no guarantee the outcome would have been any different.#It's your father's fault.",
	"Events.Anniversary.6.1": "I am well aware... I just can't help the thought...$3#$b#If we had been present, maybe something would have stopped her from going out that day... Maybe HE really could have convinced her to lay down her blade...$3",
	"Events.Anniversary.6.2": "Do NOT say that word.$5#$b#..I should have done everything I could to return... Even if I was still just a kid, there would have been a chance I could've made it back safely, right..?$3",
	"Events.Anniversary.7": "..I tried to bring her back, once.$3",
	"Events.Anniversary.8": "You've seen the sigil in the dirt outside my home, yes?#$b#But as it turns out, necromancy is not my forte. After a few failed attempts, I convinced myself it was for the better.$3#$b#If it did work, there was no way to confirm that she would return the same as she was...$3#$b#I know such dark arts are disrespectful to the dead, but.. I was desperate... I-I.. I couldn't bear the thought of being without her- of being alone...$2",
	"Events.Anniversary.8.Married": "You've seen the sigil in the dirt outside my old home, yes?#$b#But as it turns out, necromancy is not my forte. After a few failed attempts, I convinced myself it was for the better.$3#$b#If it did work, there was no way to confirm that she would return the same as she was...$3#$b#I know such dark arts are disrespectful to the dead, but.. I was desperate... I-I.. I couldn't bear the thought of being without her- of being alone...$2",
	"Events.Anniversary.9": "*Sniffle*",
	"Events.Anniversary.10": "..That's.. peculiar... The urge to cry is stronger than it normally is...$2#$b#Usually I can repress it- I have for years... I think speaking to you was a poor idea...$2#$b#..Please leave. I do not wish to be seen like this.$3",
	"Events.Anniversary.10.Married": "..That's.. peculiar... The urge to cry is stronger than it normally is...$2#$b#Usually I can repress it- I have for years... I shouldn't have spoke to you about this...$2#$b#..I'm sorry, but.. could you leave me be for a bit longer, darling..? I'll return home shortly, I promise...$3",
	
	
	//Post-Event Dialogue
	"Faust.PostGrave": "Run along now. I have nothing more to say.$3",
	"Faust.PostMom": "Please keep anyway from my mom's grave... Okay?$2#$b#..Or.. if you do go there.. bring her a flower or something. I'm the only one that visits her.",
	"Faust.PostDrown_Regular": "You're a good friend, @.$1#$b#..Granted, I don't have any others, so my judgement on this front has no previous experiences to draw from.$9",
	"Faust.PostDrown_Therapy": "'See a therapist'... Tch...$5",
	"Faust.PostOpen": "I ended up speaking with Elliott... It actually wasn't so bad.$1#$b#Thank you, @. If it wasn't for you, I would never have reached this point...$1",
	"Faust.PostBridge_Regular": "Y-You don't think I'm a bad kisser, do you..?$2",
	"Faust.PostBridge_Refuse": "%Faust is cursing himself under his breath.",
	
	"Elliott.PostOpen": "Faust approached me out of the blue and began to talk with me about books. I wasn't aware he was interested in reading.$1#$e#Hm... Perhaps I could get his thoughts on my novel so far...",
	"Elliott.PostBeach": "Hmm... How can I encourage Faust to get outside more..?$7",
	
	
	//Faust Dialogue
	//Gift Tastes
	"Gifts.Faust.Love": "Are you really sure you want to give this to me..?$7#$b#You have my gratitude. I'll remember this.$1",
    "Gifts.Faust.Like": "Hey, I like this. Thanks.$1",
    "Gifts.Faust.Dislike": "Is this your idea of a gift..? Huh.$3",
    "Gifts.Faust.Hate": "..The hell am I supposed to do with this?$5",
    "Gifts.Faust.Neutral": "..For me? Alright.",
	"Gifts.Faust.Positive": "You're.. giving me a birthday gift..?$7#$b#I mean, I won't turn it down... Thank you.$1",
    "Gifts.Faust.Negative": "This is.. supposed to be a birthday gift?$2#$b#As if this day isn't bad enough already...$3",
	"Gifts.Faust.StardropTea": "Whatever this is, it smells nice. Looks cool, too. I guess I'll take it.$1",
	"Gifts.Faust.BitterAlcohol": "This is for me? Nice. I like my alcohol bitter.$1#$b#You have good tastes, @.$1",
	"Gifts.Faust.SweetAlcohol": "Oh, this is nice. I don't mind the sweeter alcohols on occasion. Thanks.$1",
	"Gifts.Faust.BlueMoonWine": "Some of Sophia's wine? Thanks. She always makes good stuff.",
	"Gifts.Faust.ForageBerries": "Did you find this for me, or did you just pick this up off the side of the road?$6#$b#It really doesn't matter to me. I love these. Thanks.$1",
	"Gifts.Faust.CropBerries": "I'll never say no to fresh berries. Thanks, @.$1",
	"Gifts.Faust.MushroomBerryRice": "Did you.. make this for me? Really?$7#$b#That's.. nice. Really nice, actually. Thanks, @. I really like this dish.$1",
	"Gifts.Faust.Ingredient": "Nice, I'll use this to make dinner. Guess I'm having Mushroom Berry Rice tonight. Thanks.$1",
	"Gifts.Faust.Coffee": "Oh, this is just what I needed. I was starting to feel tired.$1#$b#..Wait, have you just been carrying around a loose cup of coffee in your bag..?",
	"Gifts.Faust.GhostCrystal": "Facinating... It reminds me of the departed...$7#$b#This is really cool. Thank you, @.$1",
	"Gifts.Faust.Sword": "This blade appears quite old. I promise you I'll take care of it.$7",
	"Gifts.Faust.Essence": "The essence of a monster... Cool. Thanks.$1",
	"Gifts.Faust.SlimeBerry": "This doesn't look like it'll taste good, but thanks, I guess.",
	"Gifts.Faust.SalmonDinner": "..I'll have you know I'm throwing this out first chance I get.$5",
	
	
	//Movies
	"Movies.Faust.Invite": "I'm not really interested in movies, but since you went out of your way to buy this for me, I suppose I am obligated to accompany you...#$b#But if the film's boring, I'm gonna fall asleep.$3",
    "Movies.Faust.Invite.Spouse": "For what reason do you think you need to ask your husband out on a date? Do you fear our relationship is getting worse?$7#$b#..I'm messing with you. Of course I'll come to the theater with you, my darling.$6",
	
    "Movies.Faust.Sapling.1": "..Did you bring me here to watch a movie for kids..?$3",
    "Movies.Faust.Sapling.2": "Faust is dozing off...",
    "Movies.Faust.Sapling.3": "Hng..? It's over..? About time...$9",
	
    "Movies.Faust.Prairie.1": "I don't need to have played the game to understand the plot, do I?",
    "Movies.Faust.Prairie.2": "...$1",
    "Movies.Faust.Prairie.3": "That was fine. Thanks for inviting me, I guess.$1",
	
    "Movies.Faust.Coldstar.1": "Don't take too long. I don't have all day.",
    "Movies.Faust.Coldstar.2": "It appears Faust is falling asleep...",
    "Movies.Faust.Coldstar.3": "What a bore... As expected of a holiday movie. I couldn't keep my eyes open.$9",
	
    "Movies.Faust.Mysterium.1": "The description is really vague... I guess that's interesting, in a way.",
    "Movies.Faust.Mysterium.2": "Oh! You didn't tell me we were watching a horror film.$6",
    "Movies.Faust.Mysterium.3": "So, it wasn't exactly a horror movie... It was just a collection of random images thrown together...#$b#I still liked it. It kept me awake.$6",
	
    "Movies.Faust.Wonders.1": "So we're just watching someone talk about nature? Eh, it could be worse.",
    "Movies.Faust.Wonders.2": "I guess this isn't too bad...",
    "Movies.Faust.Wonders.3": "That was actually a rather nice film...$7",
	
    "Movies.Faust.Wumbus.1": "This doesn't look like something I'd be interested in...$3",
    "Movies.Faust.Wumbus.2": "Faust is already asleep.",
    "Movies.Faust.Wumbus.3": "*Yawn*... I assume I didn't miss anything?$9#$b#Next time you invite me to a movie, the very least you could do is take me to see something you think I'd like.$3",
	
    "Movies.Faust.Howls.1": "I heard this is one of those 'found footage' type of films...$1#$b#Y'know, where they lie and say that they somehow chanced upon a recording of something scary, and try to make people think it was a real event.$6",
    "Movies.Faust.Howls.2": "Try not to scream if you get scared.",
    "Movies.Faust.Howls.3": "A little underwhelming, but I had fun. Thanks.$1",
	
    "Movies.Faust.Zuzu.1": "I think I saw my mom watching this once or twice, but I was too little to grasp the plot.$7",
    "Movies.Faust.Zuzu.2": "This better be good...",
    "Movies.Faust.Zuzu.3": "The writing was actually pretty solid for an old romance movie. No wonder why mom liked it so much.$7",
	
	
	//Day specific
	"Faust.Spring12.1": "",
	"Faust.Spring12.2": "The Egg Festival is such a childish thing...$3#$b#But it makes other people happy, so it's not bad, I suppose.",
	"Faust.Spring23.1": "",
	"Faust.Spring23.2": "The Flower Dance is tomorrow..? Ugh...$3",
	
	"Faust.Summer10.1": "Would it be funny if I put baneberries in the soup this year?$6#$e#..Relax, I was obviously kidding.$3",
	"Faust.Summer10.2": "I guess I could just pick up a spice berry on my way to the Luau tomorrow...",
	"Faust.Summer19": "Thank Yoba I won't have to deal with this blasted heat in a few days...$9",
	"Faust.Summer27.1": "The Dance of the Moonlight Jellies is kinda cool.#$b#I already stay up late every night, so I never miss it.$1",
	"Faust.Summer27.2": "It's getting colder and the leaves are starting to die. That means summer is almost over.$1#$b#It also means the Dance of the Moonlight Jellies is tomorrow.$1",
	
	"Faust.Fall1": "Fall is my favorite season.$1",
	"Faust.Fall8": "Don't pick all the blackberries. Leave some for me.$3",
	"Faust.Fall15.1": "I don't care much about the Fair. Too many people show up, and the town gets too lively.$2",
	"Faust.Fall15.2": "..Are you looking forward to the Fair tomorrow?",
	"Faust.Fall26.1": "Spirit's Eve is my favorite festival. I wouldn't miss it for the world.$1",
	"Faust.Fall26.2": "The monsters they show off at Spirit's Eve are really cool.$1",
	"Faust.Fall28.1": "Eugh, I already feel older...$3",
	"Faust.Fall28.2.A": "Another year closer to my inevitable death... Perhaps I should celebrate this merriment with a pint.",
	"Faust.Fall28.2.B": "Maybe I'll treat myself to some pie today, to make this day less miserable.$2",
	
	"Faust.Winter7.1": "I always forget the Festival of Ice is a thing until we're right on it's doorstep.$9#$b#Eh. Fishing isn't my thing.",
	"Faust.Winter7.2": "Are you gonna take part in the fishing competition?",
	"Faust.Winter12": "..Leave me be...$3",
	"Faust.Winter24.1": "I leave flowers at every grave in town on the Feast of the Winter Star. They appreciate my gifts more than some of the townsfolks.",
	"Faust.Winter24.2": "I feel like the Feast of the Winter Star puts more focus on the gift-giving part rather than the actual feast.$9",
	
	
	//Monday
	"Faust.Mon": "Spring is a pleasant season. I prefer fall more, though.$1",
	"Faust.Mon4": "I'd like to believe that all spirits pass on to the afterlife, regardless of whether they believe in Yoba or not.",
	"Faust.Mon6": "What's even the point of anything..?$9#$b#..Oh, greetings, @.#$e#Have you ever pondered the meaning of our existence, and thus remembered the futility of our lives?$2#$b#I believe we are supposed to find our own meaning, but in the end, everything is for nothing...$2",
	"Faust.Mon8": "Come talk to me whenever you want. I'm never doing anything important anyway.$1",
	
	"Faust.Summer.Mon": "..Hello.",
	"Faust.Summer.Mon2": "I've lived here for years, but I don't really have friends.$2#$e#..Why are you talking to me, anyway? Do you want something?$3",
	"Faust.Summer.Mon4": "Sebastian and Abigail are cool, Elliott has good taste in literature, and I imagine I could get along with Shane, but I can't bring myself to approach anyone...$2#$b#No point complaining about being lonely if it's my own fault.",
	"Faust.Summer.Mon4.Alt": "Talking to other people is actually kind of nice, but it still makes my heart race...",
	"Faust.Summer.Mon8": "If you ever need help in the mines, I'm pretty good with a sword.$1",

	"Faust.Fall.Mon": "..What was your name again..?$3",
	"Faust.Fall.Mon2": "Greetings, @.#$e#Sorry, I'm not up for chatting. I'm sleepy.$9",
	"Faust.Fall.Mon4": "If I told you I'm actually a ghost, would you believe me?$6",
	"Faust.Fall.Mon8": "If you ever can't sleep, you could always come visit the graveyard... Chances are I'll probably be awake.",
	"Faust.Fall.Mon8.NoSVE": "If you ever can't sleep, you could always come visit me... Chances are I'll probably be awake.",
	
	"Faust.Winter.Mon": "..I didn't drink enough coffee this morning...$9",
	"Faust.Winter.Mon4": "Do you think I should try talking to people..?$2#$e#..Nah. Nevermind. That's just a bad idea.$3",
	"Faust.Winter.Mon6": "Hey, @. We're friends, right?$1#$b#..Sorry, I haven't slept in three days. Just ignore whatever I say.$9",
	"Faust.Winter.Mon8": "Sir Marlon has told me a lot of stories about the adventurers who have graves in the cemetery. If you'd like, I can tell you a few sometime.",
	"Faust.Winter.Mon8.NoSVE": "Sir Marlon has told me a lot of stories about adventurers of the past. If you'd like, I can tell you a few sometime.",
	"Faust.Winter.Mon10": "A few years ago, if you'd told me I'd be in a happy relationship with someone, I would've laughed in your face.$8#$b#You.. make me happy, @.$4",
	
	
	//Tuesday
	"Faust.Tue": "Greetings.#$e#Have you eaten today?",
	"Faust.Tue2": "I try my best to keep the spirits in both graveyards pleased.#$b#If I don't, they'll devour me in my sleep. Maybe they'll go for you next... Heh.$6",
	"Faust.Tue2.NoSVE": "I try my best to keep the spirits in the graveyard pleased.#$b#If I don't, they'll devour me in my sleep. Maybe they'll go for you next... Heh.$6",
	"Faust.Tue4": "I admire all of the people memorialized in the Guild's graveyard. All those lost lives once defended their home until their dying breath.",
	"Faust.Tue4.NoSVE": "I think it is noble to be willing to face death in order to protect one's home. That's why I admire the Adventurer's Guild so much.",
	"Faust.Tue10": "If my mother was still around, I'm sure she'd approve of you.$1",
	
	"Faust.Summer.Tue": "Blegh. Summer... I hate summer...$3",
	"Faust.Summer.Tue2": "I spend most of my time around headstones, so I'm not very social.",
	"Faust.Summer.Tue6": "I'm more comfortable standing alone in the graveyard than hanging out with other people... Is that pathetic?$2",
	"Faust.Summer.Tue6.Alt": "Is it weird that I still like standing around in the graveyard alone, even though I have friends..?#$b#It makes me feel safe...$9",
	"Faust.Summer.Tue10": "Well well well, look who it is. Running around like you always do, huh?$6#$b#You look good today, y'know. ..Just thought I should tell you.$6",
	
	"Faust.Fall.Tue": "..Tired...$9",
	"Faust.Fall.Tue4": "My mom used to compare me to a bird because I'd always eat berries and seeds.$9#$e#Honestly, if I was a bird, I'd probably be a crow.$7",
	"Faust.Fall.Tue6": "..You know, if you ever wanted to read one of my books, I suppose I could lend one to you...$7",
	
	"Faust.Winter.Tue": "Keep warm today. It's especially cold out.",
	"Faust.Winter.Tue4": "I imagine you aren't fond of winter, since you can't grow any crops outdoors.#$b#I hope you find a way to keep yourself busy.",
	"Faust.Winter.Tue8": "I'm glad you moved to the Valley. It's nice having someone to talk to.",
	"Faust.Winter.Tue8.Alt": "If you never moved to the Valley, I don't think I ever would have made friends- let alone more than one.$1",
	
	
	//Wednesday
	"Faust.Wed": "Oh, it's you.#$e#Has your day been well?",
	"Faust.Wed4": "If I told you I'm actually a ghost, would you believe me?$6",
	"Faust.Wed6": "Is it weird that I can doze off while standing up..?$9#$e#..Maybe I'm secretly a horse. You'll never know.$6",
	"Faust.Wed8": "I'm trying to get out more. Have you noticed?",
	
	"Faust.Summer.Wed": "..Did you sleep well last night?#$e#Sorry, I'm not one for idle conversation with strangers.",
	"Faust.Summer.Wed2": "Greetings, @.#$e#Sorry, I'm not up for chatting. I'm sleepy.$9",
	"Faust.Summer.Wed6": "I've been trying to get more sleep lately by going to bed early.#$b#..It hasn't been working.$2",
	"Faust.Summer.Wed8": "If you showed up at my house early enough, I'd be open to sharing some of my coffee with you.$1",
	
	"Faust.Fall.Wed": "%He doesn't notice you. He looks tired.",
	"Faust.Fall.Wed4": "Do you like crows, @?#$b#Personally, I think they're cool, but they probably eat your crops, don't they?$1",
	"Faust.Fall.Wed6": "Some mornings, I like to put whiskey in my coffee. It tastes good.$6#$e#Not too much, though. The first time I did it, it ended up being more whiskey with caffine than coffee with alcohol.#$b#I drank too much of it since I hadn't slept the night prior, and ended up falling asleep in the town cemetery. I still haven't forgiven myself.$2",
	"Faust.Fall.Wed10": "Hey, could I.. take a nap on your shoulder? I'm tired...$9#$b#..Wait, no- You're busy. I wouldn't wanna be a burden on you.$2",
	
	"Faust.Winter.Wed": "..What was your name again..?$3",
	"Faust.Winter.Wed2": "I spend most of my time around headstones, so I'm not very social.",
	"Faust.Winter.Wed6": "..You know, if you ever wanted to read one of my books, I suppose I could lend one to you...$7",
	"Faust.Winter.Wed8": "If you ever need help in the mines, I'm pretty good with a sword.$1",
	
	
	//Thursday
	"Faust.Thu": "..Hello.",
	"Faust.Thu2": "If any of the animals on your farm die, tell me where you want them buried. Nothing deserves to just lie around and rot.",
	"Faust.Thu6": "Are you gonna be stopping by the saloon tomorrow night? It'd be nice to have some company.$1",
	"Faust.Thu6.Alt": "Are you gonna be stopping by the saloon tomorrow night? It'd be nice to see you there.$1",
	
	"Faust.Summer.Thu": "..Tired...$9",
	"Faust.Summer.Thu4": "Isn't it strange how in most places, baneberries are completely inedible, but the ones that grow in Stardew Valley can be consumed if you cook them right?#$e#Same with some types of poisonous mushrooms.",
	"Faust.Summer.Thu4.NoSVE": "Sometimes, I wonder how holly berries taste, but I'm not foolish enough to try them.#$b#..At least not any time soon.$6",
	"Faust.Summer.Thu6": "Y'know, the spots on my neck are actually from a vampire bite.$6#$e#..I'm kidding, obviously. Don't look so concerned.$3",
	"Faust.Summer.Thu8": "If you ever can't sleep, you could always come visit the graveyard... Chances are I'll probably be awake.",
	"Faust.Summer.Thu8.NoSVE": "If you ever can't sleep, you could always come visit me... Chances are I'll probably be awake.",
	
	"Faust.Fall.Thu": "Oh, it's you.#$e#Has your day been well?",
	"Faust.Fall.Thu2": "I try my best to keep the spirits in both graveyards pleased.#$b#If I don't, they'll devour me in my sleep. Maybe they'll go for you next... Heh.$6",
	"Faust.Fall.Thu2.NoSVE": "I try my best to keep the spirits in the graveyard pleased.#$b#If I don't, they'll devour me in my sleep. Maybe they'll go for you next... Heh.$6",
	"Faust.Fall.Thu4": "Sebastian and Abigail are cool, Elliott has good taste in literature, and I imagine I could get along with Shane, but I can't bring myself to approach anyone...$2#$b#No point complaining about being lonely if it's my own fault.",
	"Faust.Fall.Thu4.Alt": "Talking to other people is actually kind of nice, but it still makes my heart race...",
	"Faust.Fall.Thu8": "Hey, uhm... Would you like me to bake you a pie sometime?$7#$b#I've been working on my baking skills so I can make some of my mom's old recipes, and I'd like some feedback...$7",
	"Faust.Fall.Thu8.NoSVE": "Hey, uhm... Would you like me to bake you a cobbler sometime?$7#$b#I've been working on my baking skills so I can make some of my mom's old recipes, and I'd like some feedback...$7",
	
	"Faust.Winter.Thu": "Winter makes me so sleepy...$9",
	"Faust.Winter.Thu4": "Do you like crows, @?#$b#Personally, I think they're cool, but they probably eat your crops, don't they?$1",
	"Faust.Winter.Thu6": "Is it weird that I can doze off while standing up..?$9#$e#..Maybe I'm secretly a horse. You'll never know.$6",
	
	
	//Friday
	"Faust.Fri": "%He doesn't notice you. He looks tired.",
	"Faust.Fri2": "Why can't salmonberries grow all season..?$9",
	"Faust.Fri6": "Some mornings, I like to put whiskey in my coffee. It tastes good.$6#$e#Not too much, though. The first time I did it, it ended up being more whiskey with caffine than coffee with alcohol.#$b#I drank too much of it since I hadn't slept the night prior, and ended up falling asleep in the town cemetery. I still haven't forgiven myself.$2",
	"Faust.Fri8": "Hey, I was wondering if I'd see you today!$1#$b#Kind of suspicious that you show up right when I was thinking about you... Are you a witch or something, @?$6#$e#..I'm kidding. I don't think you're a witch.#$b#But honestly, I wouldn't care if you were. I think it'd be cool.$6",
	
	"Faust.Summer.Fri": "Greetings.#$e#Have you eaten today?",
	"Faust.Summer.Fri2": "The saloon gets so rowdy on Fridays, but I don't mind it. It's a saloon, after all.",
	"Faust.Summer.Fri4": "Pelican Town is such a peaceful place... It's perfect for me.$1",
	"Faust.Summer.Fri10": "A few years ago, if you'd told me I'd be in a happy relationship with someone, I would've laughed in your face.$8#$b#You.. make me happy, @.$4",
	
	"Faust.Fall.Fri": "I was up really late last night... Like always.",
	"Faust.Fall.Fri4": "Isn't it strange how in most places, baneberries are completely inedible, but the ones that grow in Stardew Valley can be consumed if you cook them right?#$e#Same with some types of poisonous mushrooms.",
	"Faust.Fall.Fri4.NoSVE": "Sometimes, I wonder how holly berries taste, but I'm not foolish enough to try them.#$b#..At least not any time soon.$6",
	"Faust.Fall.Fri6": "Hey, @. We're friends, right?$1#$b#..Sorry, I haven't slept in three days. Just ignore whatever I say.$9",
	"Faust.Fall.Fri8": "Come talk to me whenever you want. I'm never doing anything important anyway.$1",
	
	"Faust.Winter.Fri": "..Did you sleep well last night?#$e#Sorry, I'm not one for idle conversation with strangers.",
	"Faust.Winter.Fri2": "The saloon gets so rowdy on Fridays, but I don't mind it. It's a saloon, after all.",
	"Faust.Winter.Fri6": "Are you gonna be stopping by the saloon tonight? It'd be nice to have some company.$1",
	"Faust.Winter.Fri6.Alt": "Are you gonna be stopping by the saloon tomorrow night? It'd be nice to see you there.$1",
	"Faust.Winter.Fri10": "If my mother was still around, I'm sure she'd approve of you.$1",
	
	
	//Saturday
	"Faust.Sat": "..I didn't drink enough coffee this morning...$9",
	"Faust.Sat4": "My mom used to compare me to a bird because I'd always eat berries and seeds.$9#$e#Honestly, if I was a bird, I'd probably be a crow.$7",
	"Faust.Sat8": "I'm glad you moved to the Valley. It's nice having someone to talk to.",
	"Faust.Sat8.Alt": "If you never moved to the Valley, I don't think I ever would have made friends- let alone more than one.$1",
	"Faust.Sat10": "Hey, could I.. take a nap on your shoulder? I'm tired...$9#$b#..Wait, no- You're busy. I wouldn't wanna be a burden on you.$2",
	
	"Faust.Summer.Sat": "I was up really late last night... Like always.",
	"Faust.Summer.Sat2": "If any of the animals on your farm die, tell me where you want them buried. Nothing deserves to just lie around and rot.",
	"Faust.Summer.Sat6": "What's even the point of anything..?$9#$b#..Oh, greetings, @.#$e#Have you ever pondered the meaning of our existence, and thus remembered the futility of our lives?$2#$b#I believe we are supposed to find our own meaning, but in the end, everything is for nothing...$2",
	
	"Faust.Fall.Sat": "Look at all the dead leaves outside... Aren't they nice?$1",
	"Faust.Fall.Sat4": "I get most of my food from foraging, so I've come to enjoy the berries I can just pick off the ground or bushes more than the ones I can buy at the store.",
	"Faust.Fall.Sat6": "Y'know, the spots on my neck are actually from a vampire bite.$6#$e#..I'm kidding, obviously. Don't look so concerned.$3",
	"Faust.Fall.Sat8": "Hey, I was wondering if I'd see you today!$1#$b#Kind of suspicious that you show up right when I was thinking about you... Are you a witch or something, @?$6#$e#..I'm kidding. I don't think you're a witch.#$b#But honestly, I wouldn't care if you were. I think it'd be cool.$6",
	
	"Faust.Winter.Sat": "..Hello.",
	"Faust.Winter.Sat2": "I've lived here for years, but I don't really have friends.$2#$e#..Why are you talking to me, anyway? Do you want something?$3",
	"Faust.Winter.Sat4": "I admire all of the people memorialized in the Guild's graveyard. All those lost lives once defended their home until their dying breath.",
	"Faust.Winter.Sat4.NoSVE": "I think it is noble to be willing to face death in order to protect one's home. That's why I admire the Adventurer's Guild so much.",
	"Faust.Winter.Sat8": "I'm trying to get out more. Have you noticed?",
	
	
	//Sunday
	"Faust.Sun": "May Yoba bless you today.",
	"Faust.Sun4": "Do you think I should try talking to people..?$2#$e#..Nah. Nevermind. That's just a bad idea.$3",
	"Faust.Sun6": "I'm more comfortable standing alone in the graveyard than hanging out with other people... Is that pathetic?$2",
	"Faust.Sun6.Alt": "Is it weird that I still like standing around in the graveyard alone, even though I have friends..?#$b#It makes me feel safe...$9",
	"Faust.Sun8": "If you showed up at my house early enough, I'd be open to sharing some of my coffee with you.$1",
	
	"Faust.Summer.Sun": "May Yoba bless you today.",
	"Faust.Summer.Sun2": "..Oh, hey, @. May Yoba bless you today.",
	"Faust.Summer.Sun4": "I get most of my food from foraging, so I've come to enjoy the berries I can just pick off the ground or bushes more than the ones I can buy at the store.",
	"Faust.Summer.Sun8": "Sir Marlon has told me a lot of stories about the adventurers who have graves in the cemetery. If you'd like, I can tell you a few sometime.",
	"Faust.Summer.Sun8.NoSVE": "Sir Marlon has told me a lot of stories about adventurers of the past. If you'd like, I can tell you a few sometime.",
	
	"Faust.Fall.Sun": "May Yoba bless you today.",
	"Faust.Fall.Sun4": "I'd like to believe that all spirits pass on to the afterlife, regardless of whether they believe in Yoba or not.",
	"Faust.Fall.Sun6": "I've been trying to get more sleep lately by going to bed early.#$b#..It hasn't been working.$2",
	"Faust.Fall.Sun10": "Well well well, look who it is. Running around like you always do, huh?$6#$b#You look good today, y'know. ..Just thought I should tell you.$6",
	
	"Faust.Winter.Sun": "May Yoba bless you today.",
	"Faust.Winter.Sun2": "..Oh, hey, @. May Yoba bless you today.",
	"Faust.Winter.Sun4": "Pelican Town is such a peaceful place... It's perfect for me.$1",
	"Faust.Winter.Sun8": "Hey, uhm... Would you like me to bake you a pie sometime?$7#$b#I've been working on my baking skills so I can make some of my mom's old recipes, and I'd like some feedback...$7",
	"Faust.Winter.Sun8.NoSVE": "Hey, uhm... Would you like me to bake you a cobbler sometime?$7#$b#I've been working on my baking skills so I can make some of my mom's old recipes, and I'd like some feedback...$7",
	
	
	//Dating & Stuff
	"Faust.Refusal.0HA": "..Oh. Uh.. cool flowers.",
	"Faust.Refusal.0HB": "Why are you showing these to me..? I couldn't care less who you date.$3",
	"Faust.Reject.2HA": "Is this a joke..? You have an odd sense of humor.$3",
	"Faust.Reject.2HB": "What? No, I don't want this. Why would you think that?$3",
	"Faust.Reject.4HA": "Come on, don't tell me your standards are so low that you think *I* would be a good boyfriend.$2",
	"Faust.Reject.4HB": "I don't want your flowers.$3",
	"Faust.RefusalKnown.A": "Not interested.$3",
	"Faust.RefusalKnown.B": "Do I really look like the kind of person who'd be interested in marriage?#3",
	"Faust.RefusalBother.A": "I've already turned you down. What more do you want? A written refusal?$5",
	"Faust.RefusalBother.B": "Leave me alone. Are you really that desperate?$5",
	"Faust.RefusalEngaged.A": "..I'm gonna pretend you didn't offer this to me.$5",
	"Faust.RefusalEngaged.B": "Sorry to remind you, but you're engaged. Knock it off.$5",
	"Faust.Married.A": "Shame on you.$5",
	"Faust.Married.B": "It would be a shame if your spouse found out about this.$5",
	"Faust.GiveFlowers.A": "Huh..?$7#$b#Wait, you.. want to date me, of all people..?$8#$b#..A-Alright, I guess we can try...$8",
	"Faust.GiveFlowers.B": "..!$7#$b#Out of everyone here, you.. want to date me??$8#$b#I.. guess we can try it...$8",
	"Faust.GivePendant": "A.. Mermaid's Pendant..?!$7#$b#A-Are you sure? Like, are you really, *really* sure?? You won't be able to back out unless you spend a bunch of money, and I don't want you to regret anything...$8#$b#..If you insist, I'll handle talking to Sir Lewis about it. If everything goes well, we should be able to have our wedding in 3 days.$4#$b#..I... I'm really looking forward to it..!$4",
	
	"Faust.BreakUp": "..Oh. Okay. That's fine.$2",
	"Faust.SecondChance": "You want to try again..?$7#$b#Well, alright, I suppose. You're lucky I'm so forgiving.$6",
	"Faust.Dating": "I really don't know what to say... This is a huge shock to me...$4#$b#Have you liked me for a while, or is this just a spontaneous thing? Since you had to buy the flowers, I'm assuming you've thought about this at least a little bit.$8#$b#This is all really hard to believe... I feel like I might wake up and find out this was a dream.$4",
	"Faust.Dating.OneDay": "Just to confirm, we *are* dating, right..?$8#$b#G-Great! That's great-!$4#$b#..I mean- Cool. It's really no big deal though.$3#$e#..I'm embarrassing myself, aren't I?$9",
	"Faust.Dating.OneYear": "It's been a year since we started dating... Honestly, I can't believe you've stayed with me for so long.$7#$b#I know I wouldn't have. Heh.$6#$e#..Sorry. I'll try not to be depressing today.$9",
	"Faust.PostWedding": "This land is much bigger than I thought..!$7#$b#It's.. hard to believe that we're actually married now... The way life works out is so strange...$8#$b#I'll get settled in here while you go about your farm work. I'll be waiting for you to come back.$1",
	"Faust.StardropGift": "Hey, I got this for you. It's supposed to give you more energy. Thought it would help you out a bit.$1#$b#Also, I wanna remind you that I love you. A lot, actually.$4#$b#..That's all I have to say. I just wanted to do something nice for you.$1",
	
	
	//Engagement Dialogue
	"Engagement.Faust0": "Oh man... I'm gonna make sure I get some sleep before the wedding won't I? I don't know if I'll be able to...$9",
	"Engagement.Faust1": "This upcoming wedding is really making me anxious, but at least I have something to look forward to...$4",
	
	
	//Other
	"Faust.Introduction": "..?$3#$b#Are you new here?#$b#My name is Faust. I've taken upon the role of Groundskeeper for the cemeteries here.#$b#We likely won't be seeing much of each other. Please don't disrespect any of the graves.$3",
	"Faust.Introduction.NoSVE": "..?$3#$b#Are you new here?#$b#My name is Faust. I've taken upon the role of Groundskeeper for the cemetery here.#$b#We likely won't be seeing much of each other. Please don't disrespect any of the graves.$3",
	
	"Faust.Resort.Entering": "",
    "Faust.Resort.Leaving": "",
    "Faust.Resort.Leaving.2": "",
    "Faust.Resort.Shore": "",
    "Faust.Resort.Wander": "",
    "Faust.Resort.Bar": "",
    "Faust.Resort.Towel": "",
    "Faust.Resort.Chair": "",
	
	"Faust.DanceAccept": "..Wait, you.. want to dance with me? Really??$7#$b#Uhm... Alright... I'm looking forward to it, I guess?$8",
	"Faust.DanceAcceptSpouse": "Of course I'll dance with you, darling.$1#$b#It's honestly kind of funny you felt the need to ask. I just assumed we were dancing together already.$6",
	"Faust.DanceRejection": "..Why would I want to dance with you?$3",
	
	"Faust.GreenRain": "I don't get why people are making such a fuss over the rain... *yawn*$9#$b#Sorry, I skipped my morning coffee to be here. Gus said the saloon would be open all day.$9",
	"Faust.GreenRain.2": "I guess this rain gives me something to do. I'll have to spend all of tomorrow morning cleaning off the gravestones.",
	"Faust.GreenRainFinished": "Moss grew all over the headstones because of the rain... I had to spend the entire morning cleaning them off! $5",
	
	"Faust.Divorced": "Begone. I cannot stand your presence.$5",
	"Faust.GiftDivorced": "Do you really think I'd accept anything from you?$5",
	"Faust.FlowersDivorced": "If you want, I could throw those out for you.$5",
	"Faust.PendantDivorced": "Not funny. Get out of my sight.$5",
	"Faust.TicketDivorced": "Why would I want to see a movie with YOU?$5",
	"Faust.MemoryWipe": "..Wait, who are you? How long have you lived here??#$b#..Whatever. My name is Faust. I've taken upon the role of Groundskeeper for the cemeteries here.#$b#We likely won't be seeing much of each other. Please don't disrespect any of the graves.$3",
	"Faust.MemoryWipe.NoSVE": "..Wait, who are you? How long have you lived here??#$b#..Whatever. My name is Faust. I've taken upon the role of Groundskeeper for the cemetery here.#$b#We likely won't be seeing much of each other. Please don't disrespect any of the graves.$3",
	
	"Faust.LandslideClear.OneWeek": "So you say you are a farmer? I suppose that is interesting.$7#$b#There are many farmers in Stardew Valley. I assume you've met the ones here in Pelican Town by now.",
	"Faust.LandslideClear.OneWeek.NoSVE": "So you say you are a farmer? I suppose that is interesting.$7#$b#I suppose having a farmer in town would be a good thing for the community...",
	"Faust.HouseFirstEntry": "Don't touch any of my books while you're in my house.$3",
	"Faust.RailroadFirstEntry": "I'm glad I'm able to come back down the mountain again.#$b#I was starting to run out of alcohol.$9#$e#..Lady Susan made sure I got food, so no, I wasn't starving.",
	"Faust.RailroadFirstEntry.NoSVE": "I'm glad I'm able to come back down the mountain again.#$b#I was starting to run out of alcohol.$9#$e#..Some edible stuff grows up by the railroad, so no, I wasn't starving.",
	"Faust.Mines": "Sir Marlon said you're getting pretty close to the bottom of the mines. That's really impressive.$6#$b#Honestly, I never pinned you as the adventuring type. Guess I was wrong.$6",
	
	"Faust.PierreShop": "..Oh, hey. Are you here to buy seeds?#$b#I'm just doing my weekly grocery shopping.#$b#Some of Pierre's prices are absurd. ..But don't tell him I said that.$9",
	"Faust.Saloon.1": "Will there be any end to my misery..?$3",
	"Faust.Saloon.2": "Don't bother me. Can't you see I'm busy?$3#$b#..I'm lying. I'm not busy, I'm just not in a good mood.",
	"Faust.Saloon.3": "Avert your eyes and leave me be...$3",
	"Faust.Saloon.4": "For what reason do we draw breath but to suffer..?$3#$b#..Sorry, I'm being dramatic. Don't listen to my mumbling.$9",
	"Faust.Saloon.5": "Do you think Sir Gus views me as a burden..?$2",
	"Faust.Saloon.4Hearts.1": "..Oh, hi, @.",
	"Faust.Saloon.4Hearts.2": "I do wish this place was less jovial...$3#$b#..But.. it is a welcome distraction from my thoughts, I suppose...",
	"Faust.Saloon.4Hearts.3": "Would you care to sit by me? I could use a distracting conversation.$1",
	"Faust.Saloon.4Hearts.4": "Don't linger in this place too long. You wouldn't wish to end up like me.",
	"Faust.Saloon.4Hearts.5": "..Eh, I don't feel like talking right now. Sorry.$3",
	"Faust.Saloon.8Hearts.1": "Hey, @. I was hoping you'd show up.$1",
	"Faust.Saloon.8Hearts.2": "It isn't wrong to have feelings for two people at once, right..?#$b#..I'm just being hypothetical, of course!$8",
	"Faust.Saloon.8Hearts.3": "You can sit by me, if you'd like. I'll even buy you a drink.$1#$b#..Just a few, though. My tab is high enough as it is.",
	"Faust.Saloon.8Hearts.4": "I guess the cheery atmosphere here isn't so bad...",
	"Faust.Saloon.8Hearts.5": "..Sorry, I'm not in the mood to talk. Maybe later though?$2",
	"Faust.Saloon.Dating.1": "There you are, @.$1#$b#I'm always happy to see your face.$4",
	"Faust.Saloon.Dating.2": "Err- I-I'm sorry, could you maybe.. go somewhere else?$2#$b#I'm a few drinks in, and I fear I might start waxing poetic if I stare at you for too long...$2",
	"Faust.Saloon.Elliott.1": "%His attention is on someone else.",
	"Faust.Saloon.Elliott.2": "%Seems like he's lost in thought...",
	"Faust.Saloon.Elliott.3": "I don't know Leah, so I'd feel uncomfortable if I went over and sat with Elliott...$2",
	
	"Faust.ElliottFriendship.OneWeek": "I've been chatting with Elliott a lot over the past week. It's really nice to have someone that actually knows the books I'm talking about.$1",
	"Faust.ElliottFriendship.TwoWeeks": "Elliott actually let me take a peek at the novel he's been writing. I had heard he was an aspiring author, but I was still a little surprised.$7#$b#..Since he showed it to me.. do you think that means he considers me a friend..?$8",
	"Faust.ElliottFriendship.FourWeeks": "I never would have guessed that Elliott was just as lonely as I was... He's such a charming and charismatic guy.$7#$e#..What do you mean not everyone thinks that?",
	"Faust.DatingElliott": "Elliott told me the two of you started dating? That's cool, I guess. Good for you guys.#$e#..What's that look for?$3",
	"Faust.MarriedElliott": "I wish the two of you happiness for as long as you're together. You and Elliott both deserve it.",
	
	//Marriage
	"Marriage.Faust.RainyDay0": "The sound of rain against the roof is making me sleepy... But I'll try to stay awake for you.",
	"Marriage.Faust.RainyDay1": "Do you think the dead can feel the rain seeping into the dirt and into their graves?$6",
	"Marriage.Faust.RainyDay2": "Hey, at least you don't have to water your plants today.",
	"Marriage.Faust.RainyDay3": "Maybe I'll do some baking today...",
	"Marriage.Faust.RainyDay4": "Today would be a good day to reread one of my favorite books.$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.RainyDay5": "Will you be able to get home sooner since you don't have to water all your crops today?",
	"Marriage.Faust.RainyDay6": "Have a good day, alright, darling?$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.RainyDay7": "It's raining pretty heavily out there today...#$b#I would tell you to bring an umbrella, but we both know you wouldn't use it.",
	"Marriage.Faust.RainyDay8": "I don't see the appeal of running around in the rain all day, but you do you.$6",
	"Marriage.Faust.RainyDay9": "I'll be waiting here for you when you get back, so stay safe out there, alright?$1",
	
	"Marriage.Faust.RainyNight0": "Can we go to bed now..?$9",
	"Marriage.Faust.RainyNight1": "I cooked dinner for you, my darling. Enjoy.[198 199 205 219]$1#$e#When you're done, can we go straight to bed..?$9",
	"Marriage.Faust.RainyNight2": "Hey, close your eyes real quick.$1#$b#Tada~! Magic trick~ Keep it; it's for you.[18 376 402 418]$6#$e#What, you wanna know how I did it? You know a magician never reveals their secrets~$6#$b#Maybe a ghost helped me out. You'll never know~$6",
	"Marriage.Faust.RainyNight3": "Oh, welcome home. I was just about to crack open a bottle of mead. Want some?[459]$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.RainyNight4": "I ended up burning what I was baking today... *Sigh*... What horrible luck...$2#$b#Perhaps you should comfort me? This failure has left my heart mortally wounded~$6#$e#..I-I wasn't being serious, you know...$8",
	"Marriage.Faust.RainyNight5": "I spent this gloomy day baking, because why not?$1#$b#Behold! The fruit of my labor! Doesn't it look delicious?[221 234 611 FlashShifter.StardewValleyExpandedCP_Mixed_Berry_Pie]$6",
	"Marriage.Faust.RainyNight5.NoSVE": "I spent this gloomy day baking, because why not?$1#$b#Behold! The fruit of my labor! Doesn't it look delicious?[221 234 611]$6",
	"Marriage.Faust.RainyNight6": "One of these nights, we should try summoning a ghost to do all your farmwork for you.$6#$b#..I'm kidding. I would hate it if the farm started getting haunted because of me.$2",
	"Marriage.Faust.RainyNight7": "Make sure you change out of those wet clothes before you come to bed tonight.$3#$e#You don't expect me to want to hold you while you're soaked, do you?$3",
	"Marriage.Faust.RainyNight8": "There you are! Glad you made it home okay.$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.RainyNight9": "Want me to fetch a towel for you, or would you rather keep getting the floor wet?$3",
	
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorDay0": "Good morning, @.#$e#I slept well last night...$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorDay1": "I haven't had my coffee yet... Give me a few minutes...$9",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorDay2": "Come on, at least give me a kiss before you run off.$6",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorDay3": "Waking up alone in that old shack of mine seems crazy to me now... I'm glad I have you, @.$4#$e#You give me someone to talk to while I drink my coffee.$6",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorDay4": "I've been getting more than just a few hours of sleep ever since we married.$1#$b#Maybe you are some kind of witch...$6",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorDay5": "I made breakfast this morning. Here, have some.[FlashShifter.StardewValleyExpandedCP_Baked_Berry_Oatmeal 195 201 211]$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorDay5.NoSVE": "I made breakfast this morning. Here, have some.[195 201 211]$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorDay6": "There you are. I was waiting for you to wake up before having my coffee.$1#$b#I already poured you a cup. Careful, it's still hot.[395]$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorDay7": "I'm sure the cemeteries will be fine without me for a few days... Right..?",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorDay7.NoSVE": "I'm sure the cemetery will be fine without me for a few days... Right..?",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorDay8": "I was unable to sleep last night, so I decided to go for a walk.#$b#I ended procuring this for you. Enjoy, darling.[66 80 84 86 535 536]$1#$e#Now if you'll excuse me, I'm gonna go try to take a nap...$9",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorDay9": "Sometimes, I still find it hard to believe I'm actually married...$4#$b#This isn't all some elaborate dream is it? Because if it is, I'm blaming you.$6",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorDay10": "..I think my mom would be happy that I'm married to someone like you.$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorDay11": "Sorry, I'm not sharing my breakfast with you today. I'm starving.#$b#I could give you a kiss though, if you'd like.$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorDay12": "I had a good dream last night. Isn't that crazy?$1#$b#Having dreams is weird... I'm not used to it.",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorDay13": "Sorry I'm out of bed so early. I only got a few hours of sleep. But that gave me time to rearrange everything in the fridge!$1#$b#..But then I realized that might inconvenience you, so I put it all back.",
	
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorNight0": "When will you be coming to bed? I'm tired...$9",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorNight1": "Great news! I didn't drink any alcohol today. Are you proud of me?$6",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorNight2": "Are you tired, darling?#$b#Great, I am too. Come to bed already.$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorNight3": "Good work out there today, @. Cheers to you.[346]$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorNight4": "Did you find anything cool while you were out today? Can I see?$7",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorNight5": "Welcome home, my darling.$1#$b#I'm having dinner right now. Here, I'll share with you.[196 214 224 244 258 400]$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorNight6": "I made my favorite for dinner, but I didn't have enough to make any for you. Sorry...$2#$b#You can just heat up a pizza or something.$1#$e#..You want me to share with you?? But.. it's my favorite...$2#$e#Fine... You're lucky I love you so much...[FlashShifter.StardewValleyExpandedCP_Mushroom_Berry_Rice]$3",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorNight6.NoSVE": "I'm just eating berries for dinner tonight. I'm not that hungry.#$b#You aren't mad that I didn't make dinner, right? You can just heat up a pizza or something.",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorNight7": "Oh-! You're home already!$7#$b#Time flew by so fast today...",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorNight8": "Maybe tonight will be the night when I turn you into a vampire in your sleep. OoooOOOOoo, you never know~$6",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorNight9": "Can we go to sleep now? Or do you want me to check if there are any monsters under our bed first?$6",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorNight10": "I dug a few holes for fun today. ..Don't worry, I filled them back up.#$b#I wouldn't want you to fall in one while you aren't looking and hurt yourself.",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorNight11": "Can I lay my head on you while I sleep tonight? ..It might help me.",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorNight12": "Hey, uh.. do you ever think my sense of humor is annoying? I don't want to annoy you...$7#$b#Just promise you'll tell me if you want me to knock it off, alright?$7",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorNight13": "I did some cleaning today. I hope that helps you out a bit.$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.IndoorNightGeneric": "You know I can't sleep well until you're sleeping next to me.#$b#So if you run back out there and pass out who knows where, I'm gonna be upset.$3",
	
	"Marriage.Faust.Outdoor0": "Surprise! I poured you a cup of coffee.[253]$1#$e#No need to thank me. I'm just such a good husband, aren't I?$6",
	"Marriage.Faust.Outdoor1": "If you need any help today, just let me know. I'm no farmer, but I'm good at digging holes.$7",
	"Marriage.Faust.Outdoor2": "If it's not too much to ask, pick up some berries while you're running around.$1#$b#I don't care if it's from the store or off the ground. I'm just wanna eat fruit.",
	"Marriage.Faust.Outdoor3": "I'm just enjoying my breakfast out here today.$1#$b#Here, open your hand. I'll share some with you.[282 398 FlashShifter.StardewValleyExpandedCP_Bearberrys 296]$1#$e#..What? Come on, you know me by now. This isn't out of the ordinary for me.",
	"Marriage.Faust.Outdoor3.NoSVE": "I'm just enjoying my breakfast out here today.$1#$b#Here, open your hand. I'll share some with you.[282 398 296]$1#$e#..What? Come on, you know me by now. This isn't out of the ordinary for me.",
	"Marriage.Faust.Outdoor4": "Agh... The sun's too bright today...$9",
	"Marriage.Faust.Outdoor5": "The air feels surprisingly nice this morning.$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.Outdoor6": "I'm just taking a look at the farm while I drink my coffee. Don't let me bother you.$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.Outdoor7": "How can you tolerate working in these conditions..?$3#$e#I'm just being dramatic. It's actually not that bad out today.$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.Outdoor8": "I'm still tired, so I thought standing out here might wake me up.$9",
	"Marriage.Faust.Outdoor9": "If you're still tired, I can do the farmwork for you, darling.$1#$e#Granted, it would likely be done very poorly, but your wellbeing is more important.",
	
	"Marriage.Faust.OneKid0": "I know I was the one that suggested it, but.. do you really think I'm worthy of being a father..?$2#$e#At least I'll be a better one than mine by default.$3",
	"Marriage.Faust.OneKid1": "Let's not have any kind of disagreements in front of %kid1, alright? I don't care how small. I don't want them to have to bear witness to anything of the sort.",
	"Marriage.Faust.OneKid2": "I hope %kid1 doesn't inherit any of my negative qualities...$3",
	"Marriage.Faust.OneKid3": "Who would've thought raising a kid could be so hard...$9#$e#Obviously I knew it was hard. It's just even harder than I thought!$3",
	"Marriage.Faust.OneKid4": "It feels so weird when I hold %kid1. Like, I'm this kid's father..! I can hardly believe it...$7",
	"Marriage.Faust.OneKid5": "I've been having a lot more anxiety ever since %kid1 came into the family...$2#$b#I don't regret it though. I love that little rascal.$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.OneKid6": "Being a father is so tiring...$9",
	"Marriage.Faust.OneKid7": "Don't worry, I won't take any naps while watching %kid1. I'm not that irresponsible.$1",
	
	"Marriage.Faust.TwoKids0": "I never thought I would be raising a child, let alone two...",
	"Marriage.Faust.TwoKids1": "I hope both of our kids have the best possible upbringing.$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.TwoKids2": "Having two kids just means twice the screaming. Once one of them starts going, the other follows suit...$9",
	"Marriage.Faust.TwoKids3": "Our kids are such a handful, but I love them dearly.$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.TwoKids4": "I'm glad that %kid2 and %kid1 get along.$1#$b#..At least, I think they get along. Hard to tell when they don't talk.",
	"Marriage.Faust.TwoKids5": "Family is a very important thing. We need to make sure %kid1 and %kid2 understand that when they're older.$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.TwoKids6": "I'm surprised %kid1 and %kid2 are so well behaved...$7#$b#That must mean we're good parents, right?$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.TwoKids7": "I wonder if either of our children will take an interest in the Adventurer's Guild...$7#$e#A small part of me hopes not. I'd hate for anything to happen to them...$2#$b#..Sorry, it's too early for this kind of stuff.$2",
	
	"Marriage.Faust.Good0": "I love you more than anything else in the world. You know that, right?$4",
	"Marriage.Faust.Good1": "Not even death will do us part.$4",
	"Marriage.Faust.Good2": "It's hard to imagine that we would have never spoken if you weren't the one to approach me first...$7#$b#..I'm really glad you did.$4",
	"Marriage.Faust.Good3": "You're probably the best thing that's happened to me...$4#$e#But to be honest, not many good things happen to me anyway.$3",
	"Marriage.Faust.Good4": "I can't believe I'm lucky enough to have your company until we shed this mortal coil...$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.Good5": "I'll never be able to describe how I felt on our wedding day...$4",
	"Marriage.Faust.Good6": "My heart skips a beat whenever I see you...$4#$b#..Is that a bad sign? Should I see the doctor? I don't wanna go to the clinic...$2",
	"Marriage.Faust.Good7": "When you aren't around, I like looking at the Mermaid's Pendant you gave me. It reminds me of you.$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.Good8": "You mean the world to me, @. I don't know what I'd do with myself if you just up and vanished...$4",
	"Marriage.Faust.Good9": "I'm trying to be better for you, but I can't tell if I'm doing a good job or not...$2#$b#..You'll still love me even if I'm still a mess of a human being, won't you?$2",
	
	"Marriage.Faust.Neutral0": "Married life feels so strange...",
	"Marriage.Faust.Neutral1": "Something is off, but I can't put my finger on it...",
	"Marriage.Faust.Neutral2": "Hey, can we try to talk more? I want to spend time with you.$1#$b#I'm your husband, after all. You're olbigated to spend time with me!$6",
	"Marriage.Faust.Neutral3": "The house feels so empty when you aren't here...",
	"Marriage.Faust.Neutral4": "I feel so lonely when I'm at home...#$e#No, it's fine, I promise! I know you're busy...$2",
	"Marriage.Faust.Neutral5": "@, what do you see in me? Be honest.#$b#I still can't figure out why you wanted to court a weirdo like me...$2",
	"Marriage.Faust.Neutral6": "Is something wrong, @?",
	"Marriage.Faust.Neutral7": "I kind of miss living alone.#$b#There's nothing wrong with living with you. I just liked only having to feed myself every day.",
	"Marriage.Faust.Neutral8": "I think you should write a thirty-something pages long essay about how much you love me. Y'know, just to prove it.$6#$e#It would do wonders for my self-confidence.$6",
	"Marriage.Faust.Neutral9": "Just wanna remind you that divorce is expensive.#$e#..Sorry, my thoughts are being negative today. Just ignore me.$2",
	
	"Marriage.Faust.Bad0": "If I said I poisoned your food with baneberries, would you believe me?$6#$b#I'm just kidding.. unfortunately.$5",
	"Marriage.Faust.Bad0.NoSVE": "If I said I poisoned your food with red mushrooms, would you believe me?$6#$b#I'm just kidding.. unfortunately.$5",
	"Marriage.Faust.Bad1": "Why do you treat me this way? What have I ever done to you?$5",
	"Marriage.Faust.Bad2": "Do I need to remind you that we're married, or is that the reason you treat me like garbage?$5",
	"Marriage.Faust.Bad3": "Do I even mean anything to you anymore?$3",
	"Marriage.Faust.Bad4": "What was the point of everything if it would all end up like this..?$3",
	"Marriage.Faust.Bad5": "If you hate me so much, what's stopping you from divorcing me?$5#$e#Do you just like watching me suffer..?$3",
	"Marriage.Faust.Bad6": "You running out of the house every morning and moving on with your day isn't going to fix anything, you know.$5",
	"Marriage.Faust.Bad7": "Is this what you wanted? Is this the whole reason why you courted me? Just to watch me be miserable??$5",
	"Marriage.Faust.Bad8": "I refuse to talk to you right now. You don't deserve any more of my attention.$5",
	"Marriage.Faust.Bad9": "Did I do something to make you mad at me?$2",
	
	"Marriage.Faust.Spring1": "I don't get how some people want to stay up all night on the eve of a new year... I couldn't even if I wanted to.$9",
	"Marriage.Faust.Spring13": "I hope all the eggs are found this year. Those things smell awful when they rot...",
	"Marriage.Faust.Spring23": "Just wanted to remind you that the Flower Dance is tomorrow.$6#$e#Oh, that's all I wanted to say. I didn't know if you've been paying attention to the calender.",
	"Marriage.Faust.Spring24": "Hey there, darling. Are you anticipating the Dance as much as I am?$1",
	
	"Marriage.Faust.Summer1": "Euuughhh... Summer... The worst season...$9#$b#..At least it's profitable for you.$3#$e#..*And* baneberries and posion mushrooms grow in Summer, so there's that too, I guess.$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.Summer1.NoSVE": "Euuughhh... Summer... The worst season...$9#$b#..At least it's profitable for you.$3",
	"Marriage.Faust.Summer11": "Could we skip the Luau this year? I don't wanna have to stand in the sun all day...#$e#..Fine, fine. You're lucky I love you so much.$9#$b#Guess I'll pick something up off the ground to put in the soup again.",
	"Marriage.Faust.Summer28": "Don't worry, I got plenty of sleep last night, so we can watch the Moonlight Jellies together.$1#$b#I even drank three cups of coffee already, just in case.$1",
	
	"Marriage.Faust.Fall1": "There's already a chill in the air... Good. I was sick of that evil heat.$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.Fall15": "You have everything prepared for the Fair tomorrow, right?#$b#I could run off to the woods last minute and find something to fill up any empty spaces in your booth for you, if need be.$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.Fall16": "Let me know if you want any help setting up your booth today. I won't be busy.$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.Fall27": "Tonight is the best night of the year. The atmosphere is perfect.$6#$b#Sure, there's not much to do, but that just makes it better. Nice and peaceful.$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.Fall28": "%He's quiet this morning...",
	
	"Marriage.Faust.Winter1": "We're nearing the end of the year already... Time really does fly, huh?$7",
	"Marriage.Faust.Winter8": "I completely forgot about the festival today.$7#$e#Maybe I'll wander off and look for a crocus to give you. Or would you rather I stay and watch you fish?$6",
	"Marriage.Faust.Winter12": "%He doesn't say anything, but you can see the misery in his eyes.",
	"Marriage.Faust.Winter24": "The Feast of the Winter Star is tomorrow already??$7#$b#I still haven't gotten a gift yet..!$9",
	"Marriage.Faust.Winter25": "Don't worry, my gift is wrapped and ready for the Feast today.$1#$e#Hope you get something good this year, darling.$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.Winter28": "Spring starts tomorrow. I hope you're ready to get back to working in your fields, darling.$1",
	
	"Marriage.Faust.Patio0": "Why are you looking at Mephistopheles like that, @? He isn't going to eat your crops.$6",
	"Marriage.Faust.Patio1": "Mephistopheles likes it when I read to him.$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.Patio2": "I thought it might be good for me if I got some sun today, so I'm doing my reading out here.",
	"Marriage.Faust.Patio3": "You can pet Mephistopheles if you want.#$e#He'll probably peck you if you try, but it's still an option.$6",
	"Marriage.Faust.Patio4": "Hm? Do you need something, darling?$7#$b#I'm reading to Mephistopheles right now. You can listen too, if you'd like.$1",
	
	"Marriage.Faust.SpouseRoom0": "I'm reorganizing all of my books again. Don't mind me.",
	"Marriage.Faust.SpouseRoom1": "I think I'll read today. Not much else to do.$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.SpouseRoom2": "One of my books is missing... I think I might've set it on the wrong shelf...$9",
	"Marriage.Faust.SpouseRoom3": "I'm doing a bit of cleaning today.",
	"Marriage.Faust.SpouseRoom4": "We should sit down and read a book together one of these days.$1",
	
	"Marriage.Faust.FunLeave0": "I'm gonna be out today. You won't need my help with anything, will you?",
	"Marriage.Faust.FunLeave1": "Do you need me to pick up anything from the store while I'm out?",
	"Marriage.Faust.FunLeave2": "Don't do anything to the house while I'm gone.$6",
	"Marriage.Faust.FunReturn0": "I'm going straight to bed... *Yawn*$9",
	"Marriage.Faust.FunReturn1": "Lets talk in the morning, okay?$9",
	"Marriage.Faust.FunReturn2": "*Yawn*... I'm completely worn out...$9",
	
	"Marriage.Faust.Spring": "If only this season lasted longer... I'm dreading the arrival of Summer.$3",
	"Marriage.Faust.Summer": "Can we buy an air conditioner? It's too hot...$9",
	"Marriage.Faust.Fall": "The leaves outside are beautiful, wouldn't you agree?$1",
	"Marriage.Faust.Winter": "Jeez, it's cold out today...",
	
	
	//Other Dialogue
	//Elliott
	"Elliott.FaustFriendship.OneWeek": "I'm still quite surprised that Faust approached me so suddenly...#$b#I'm glad he did, though. I must admit, I had been a bit curious about his character. He's always seemed so withdrawn...#$e#You're friends with him too, yes?$1",
	"Elliott.FaustFriendship.TwoWeeks": "The other day, I allowed Faust to look at my novel so far. His reaction seemed very positive, and he offered me some good advice.$1#$b#Mayhaps I should ask others for feedback more often.",
	"Elliott.FaustFriendship.FourWeeks": "Faust allowed me to borrow one of the books from his collection!$1#$b#I must say, he has quite the large assortment of titles... It was a hard pick.",
	"Elliott.DatingElliott.Faust": "Perhaps it's just a coincidence, but Faust has seemed more.. distant since we started dating.$2",
	
	//Sebastian
	
}